THE SEVEN ARCHITECTURAL LAWS OF THE VALTARA ECOSYSTEM
LAW 1 — Nucleus: KNOW
Nucleus is the system of ecosystem state.

Nucleus owns:

the enterprise map

the entity graph

the event graph

the subsystem graph

the capability registry

responsibility boundaries

ecosystem state

“who should respond?” logic

“what happened after invocation?” tracking

Nucleus does not:

discover money

authorize money

execute money

validate domain logic

Nucleus determines:

“Given the state of the ecosystem, which capability should respond?”

Nucleus is the brain.

LAW 2 — Decision Weaver: FIND
Weaver may discover and recommend.
Weaver may not authorize or execute.

Weaver hunts across systems for:

financial leakage

underpayments

overpayments

missed recoveries

duplicate transactions

inconsistencies

suspicious relationships

systemic patterns

cross‑system anomalies

unclaimed assets

settlement discrepancies

Weaver produces:

opportunity

evidence

confidence

recommended action

Weaver is the hunter.

LAW 3 — Guardian: ALLOW
Guardian determines whether a proposed action is permitted under the organization’s financial, security, governance, and authorization policies.

Guardian evaluates:

WHO

WHAT

HOW MUCH

UNDER WHICH POLICY

WITH WHAT AUTHORITY

REQUIRING WHAT APPROVAL

Guardian does not:

discover

execute

investigate

validate domain logic

Guardian is the vault door.

LAW 4 — Glue: DO
Given an authorized decision, Glue executes the action reliably.

Glue handles:

retries

queues

scheduling

idempotency

state persistence

external APIs

human approvals

callbacks

failures

compensating actions

reconciliation

notifications

Glue does not:

decide

authorize

discover

validate

Glue is the hands.

LAW 5 — DualPay: SPECIALIZE
DualPay is the healthcare financial specialist.

DualPay owns:

claims

remits

contracts

reimbursement

denials

appeals

healthcare recovery

healthcare reconciliation

DualPay does not:

authorize

execute

discover cross‑system patterns

govern money outside healthcare

DualPay is the domain expert.

LAW 6 — Boundary Integrity
No subsystem may silently cross another subsystem’s authority boundary.

This means:

Weaver never executes

Weaver never authorizes

DualPay never authorizes

Guardian never executes

Glue never decides

Nucleus never bypasses Guardian

If a subsystem encounters something outside its authority:

It must return it to Nucleus.

This prevents overlap and chaos.

LAW 7 — The Ecosystem Loop
The Valtara ecosystem operates on a continuous loop:

KNOW → FIND → ALLOW → DO → OBSERVE → KNOW

This loop is the foundation of the platform.
